ata within the year.\n\n\nI'm uncertain about interpreting the 2002 monthly values. The monthly data from August through December suggests there might be additional complexity in calculating an annual average. However, without complete monthly data for the entire year, I'll stick with my original calculation of 2,382 as the answer.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_f9c1aa1c8d52476ab6ad3c54","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/app/answer.txt","content":"2382"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
